{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2022-10-19 10:20:00', 'title': "FORBES RECOGNIZES T. ROWE PRICE AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S BEST EMPLOYERS 2022", 'text': "BALTIMORE , OCT. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- T. ROWE PRICE (NASDAQ-GS: TROW), A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT FIRM AND A LEADER IN RETIREMENT SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORBES WORLD'S BEST EMPLOYERS 2022 LIST."}